tal","tier":"L","label":"Immortal","value":"3 turns"},"sub":"CC","sub_info":{"icon":"UC-CC.webp","key":"CC","tier":"UC","label":"Any CC","value":""}},{"label":"Alt 2","main":"Guts","main_info":{"icon":"L-Guts.webp","key":"Guts","tier":"L","label":"Guts","value":"150% ATK Barrier, 4 turns"},"sub":"CC","sub_info":{"icon":"UC-CC.webp","key":"CC","tier":"UC","label":"Any CC","value":""}}]}],"dedicated":{"name":"Orly's Parasol","main_stat":"MATK +247","icon":"Orly.webp","a":[{"name":"HP%","value":"+12%","icon":"HP%25.webp"},{"name":"HP%","value":"+12%","icon":"HP%25.webp"},{"name":"HP%","value":"+12%","icon":"HP%25.webp"},{"name":"HP%","value":"+12%","icon":"HP%25.webp"}],"b":[{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"}],"second":"no","why_by_stat":{"HP%":"Orly requires high HP for bigger heals/barriers.","DMGAmp":"Increases all damage dealt by Orly by the given %, making it useful for both general damage and higher PVE scores. Also increases DOT damage."},"story":"\"When I approached, the man opened his parasol and tilted it over me — just like Charles did that day.\"\n\nDevastated by the loss of her lover Charles, Orly arrived at a forest in the south of the Moonlit Isles. There, she was lulled into deathly slumber by the intoxicating scent of fragrant flowering trees and rescued by a man named Teo. Seeing traces of her late lover in Teo's kindness, Orly instinctively recognized him as the new bond that Charles had foretold, and she began to spend her days in Teo's company."},"used_in":[{"tip":"Castle Rush (Mon/Tue/Wed)","cat":"pve","banner":"CR_MONTUESWED.webp"},{"tip":"Advent Expedition: Teo & Yeonhee","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENT_TEOYH.webp"},{"tip":"Sudden Raid: Astrea","cat":"pve","banner":"RAID_SUDDEN_ASTREA.webp"},{"tip":"Raid: Ox King","cat":"pve","banner":"RAID_OX.webp"},{"tip":"Power Up Dungeon: Gold","cat":"pve","banner":"PU_DUNGEON_GOLD.webp"},{"tip":"Adventure (Both)","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENTURE_BOTH.webp"},{"tip":"Total War","cat":"pvp","banner":"TOTALWAR.webp"}],"lore":"Orly was born into a prestigious noble family, one with a long lineage of archmages.\nShe was prophesized to be the successor to the title of archmage, but as a child, Orly had little interest in magic.\nMagic came to her as easily and naturally as breathing, so it didn't seem particularly exciting or worthy of attention.\nInstead, Orly focused on subjects like business, mathematics, history, and life skills.\nHer parents, confident in her talents, trusted her judgment and supported her desire to live freely without much interference.\nHowever, after her first love and fiancé died from a plague, Orly began to take magic seriously.\nIf she truly was meant to become an archmage as foretold, and if she had properly learned magic, perhaps she could have saved him.\nEven after enrolling in Magic Academy, she spent her days in regret.\nDespite this, her innate talent flourished at the academy, and in just two years, she graduated with perfect scores.\nAfterward, she joined the Magic Society and began making a name for herself. Yet, as her skills grew, so did the guilt of not being able to save the person who needed her most.\nUltimately, despite everyone's objections, she headed to Aisha.\nShe felt a sense of destiny calling her to the Moonlit Isles, which was embroiled in civil war at the time.\nIt was there that she met Teo.\nFrom that moment on, Orly and Teo were inseparable.\nThrough the war on the Moonlit Isles, the War of Destruction, and even to the present day..."}